WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.887 --> 00:00:03.700
- What is that thing?

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.031
It looks creepy.

00:00:07.201 --> 00:00:10.151
(Upbeat music)

00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:17.056
- [Girl] This looks like Ramen.

00:00:17.056 --> 00:00:19.045
- This tastes just like Ramen noodles.

00:00:19.045 --> 00:00:20.361
- I don't really like them.

00:00:20.361 --> 00:00:21.061
- It's good.

00:00:21.061 --> 00:00:22.206
- It's really good.

00:00:22.206 --> 00:00:24.814
- I'd give it a two out of five.

00:00:24.814 --> 00:00:25.609
- Two?

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:26.716
- I give this a five.

00:00:26.716 --> 00:00:28.452
- I definitely don't
want to eat that again.

00:00:28.452 --> 00:00:30.272
(Buzz)

00:00:30.272 --> 00:00:32.203
- Can I take these home with me?

00:00:38.423 --> 00:00:40.478
- In the shape of koala!

00:00:40.478 --> 00:00:41.257
- Mmm

00:00:41.257 --> 00:00:41.898
- Mmm

00:00:41.898 --> 00:00:42.674
- I like that one.

00:00:42.674 --> 00:00:46.018
- I was even thinking they
can make these in California.

00:00:46.018 --> 00:00:47.791
- And I bit off his poor little head.

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:49.224
I'm sorry.

00:00:49.224 --> 00:00:50.848
- I would love this as my dessert.

00:00:50.848 --> 00:00:51.939
It's really good.

00:00:51.939 --> 00:00:53.053
(Bell)

00:00:59.183 --> 00:01:00.696
- It tastes like a chocolate Rice Krispy.

00:01:00.696 --> 00:01:02.625
- It tastes like milk chocolate.

00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.198
It's really, really good.

00:01:04.198 --> 00:01:06.375
- I don't like the taste.

00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:07.245
- It's five out of five.

00:01:07.245 --> 00:01:08.665
- I'll give this a five.

00:01:08.665 --> 00:01:10.522
- It is five out of five.

00:01:16.802 --> 00:01:20.563
- [Boy] I've never eaten anything
flavored like eucalyptus.

00:01:20.563 --> 00:01:22.754
- Woah! That smells like soap.

00:01:22.754 --> 00:01:25.453
- I'm scared to eat these
because you don't know

00:01:25.453 --> 00:01:27.807
if this is poisonous for
humans in California.

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:34.513
- Can I just do one little bite?

00:01:38.123 --> 00:01:39.554
- Oh! That's horrible.

00:01:42.294 --> 00:01:44.764
- I

00:01:44.764 --> 00:01:48.343
think it's pretty good,

00:01:48.343 --> 00:01:51.299
but also kind of not.

00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:52.149
(Buzz)

00:01:53.639 --> 00:01:54.619
(Buzz)

00:01:54.619 --> 00:01:56.729
- If I were a koala, I wouldn't really

00:01:56.729 --> 00:01:59.210
like to eat eucalyptus.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.547
- I really like this one.

00:02:00.547 --> 00:02:01.577
(Bell)

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:09.169
- Veggie what?

00:02:09.169 --> 00:02:10.967
- Oh! I've heard of this.

00:02:10.967 --> 00:02:12.582
Is it Vegemite?

00:02:20.042 --> 00:02:22.811
- Bleh, I do not like the Vegemite.

00:02:22.811 --> 00:02:26.097
Bleh!

00:02:26.097 --> 00:02:30.287
- So this doesn't really pleasant me.

00:02:30.287 --> 00:02:32.780
- Spicy, weird butter.

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:38.131
- It's really sour.

00:02:38.131 --> 00:02:39.301
Ugh!

00:02:39.301 --> 00:02:40.881
- Hmm

00:02:40.881 --> 00:02:42.631
- Oh that's too horrible.

00:02:42.631 --> 00:02:44.852
- I like the chocolate.

00:02:44.852 --> 00:02:47.186
- [Voiceover] You think
that taste like chocolate?

00:02:47.186 --> 00:02:48.679
- Is it like fudge or something?

00:02:48.679 --> 00:02:49.937
What is it?

00:02:49.937 --> 00:02:51.154
- [Voiceover] Vegemite.

00:02:51.154 --> 00:02:53.249
- Vegemite. It's good.

00:02:53.249 --> 00:02:54.470
Vegemite's good.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.257
- I think Australian
snacks are actually good,

00:02:59.257 --> 00:03:01.714
but when you look at the bag,
it doesn't really look good,

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.022
but then when you try it, it's good.

00:03:04.022 --> 00:03:07.795
That's why they say don't
judge the book by its cover.

00:03:07.795 --> 00:03:09.668
- [Voiceover] Do you
know most Australian kids

00:03:09.668 --> 00:03:12.355
eat Vegemite on toast everyday?

00:03:12.355 --> 00:03:14.038
- [Girl in blue shirt] They do?

00:03:14.038 --> 00:03:16.239
Well probably out there,
they probably like it,

00:03:16.239 --> 00:03:19.530
but not people here.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:21.360
Probably some people here like it,

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.674
but me, I don't.

